# Default owners for everything in the repo.
* @Octo-Protocol-org/maintainers

# The signing / key-management core requires extra scrutiny.
/crates/wallet-core/ @Octo-Protocol-org/security
/crates/crypto/      @Octo-Protocol-org/security
/SECURITY.md         @Octo-Protocol-org/security

# Dependency manifests: every Dependabot cargo PR (crypto-crate bumps included) lands here.
# Later rules override `*`, so maintainers are listed explicitly alongside security.
/Cargo.toml                   @Octo-Protocol-org/maintainers @Octo-Protocol-org/security
/Cargo.lock                   @Octo-Protocol-org/maintainers @Octo-Protocol-org/security
/crates/crypto/Cargo.toml     @Octo-Protocol-org/maintainers @Octo-Protocol-org/security
/crates/wallet-core/Cargo.toml @Octo-Protocol-org/maintainers @Octo-Protocol-org/security

# Supply-chain controls: workflows, Dependabot policy, and scanner exception lists.
/.github/           @Octo-Protocol-org/maintainers @Octo-Protocol-org/security
/deny.toml          @Octo-Protocol-org/maintainers @Octo-Protocol-org/security
/.cargo/audit.toml  @Octo-Protocol-org/maintainers @Octo-Protocol-org/security
/.gitleaksignore    @Octo-Protocol-org/maintainers @Octo-Protocol-org/security
/scripts/check-pinned-actions.sh @Octo-Protocol-org/maintainers @Octo-Protocol-org/security
/CODEOWNERS         @Octo-Protocol-org/maintainers @Octo-Protocol-org/security